course: dictionary
lesson: 8294
title: A ritual is a set way of doing things
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A ritual is a set of actions always done in the same way and the same order. «Small rituals and regular calls keep the friendship alive.» Here, a ritual is something small and regular, like a habit that two friends keep doing.
explain: Ritual is also a word for religion and history. A religious ritual is a ceremony with set steps, such as prayers or festivals. When you meet ritual, ask what the sentence is about: is it a ceremony, or something a person always does?
explain: Try the swap check. «It is a team ritual» can become «It is a team habit» and still make sense, so ritual means something done the same way each time. Ritual can also describe things: a ritual dance is a dance done as part of a ceremony.
fact: A ritual is a set of actions always done in the same way and order.
fact: In religion, a ritual is part of a ceremony, such as prayers, baptism or a festival.
fact: A bedtime ritual is a habit, like reading a story at the same time every night.
fact: «Ritual» can also be an adjective: a ritual dance is done as part of a ceremony, or out of habit.
fact: «There is no evidence that eating bananas before a match makes you score more goals; it is a team ritual.» The banana is a team habit, not a magic trick.
exercise: «Small rituals and regular calls keep the friendship alive.» What does ritual mean here? | A kind of football boot | *Something always done in the same way | A loud argument | A sad song
exercise: Mum says, «Our family ritual is pancakes on Sunday.» What does ritual mean? | A kind of pancake | A sudden surprise | A bad mistake | *A habit always done in the same way
exercise: «The Minotaur is a myth, but bull-leaping was a real sport or ritual of the Minoans.» Find and copy one word that means a made-up story. | *myth | sport | real | Minoans
test: «Eating bananas before a match is a team ritual.» What does this tell you? | The bananas are bad for the players | *The team always does it the same way | It makes the team score more goals | It is a type of fruit
test: Which word fits? A ___ dance is done as part of a ceremony. | rapid | rural | *ritual | rustic
exam: Which is the best meaning of «a bedtime ritual»? | *A set of actions done in the same order every night | A sudden loud noise | A kind of pillow | A time to sleep for ever
